{"text": "At last we came to a deep, narrow crypt, where old bones were piled high against three of its walls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the fourth wall there was a small space about four feet deep, and Fortunato stepped into it with his weak torch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In an instant I had chained him to the rock, for two iron rings were fixed in the back wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was too surprised to resist, and I said, Once more I beg you to return, but if not, I must leave you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Amontillado, he cried, still not understanding, and I began to build a wall across the opening with stones and mortar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I had hardly laid the first row of stones when I noticed that his drunkenness had worn off. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A low moan came from the darkness, and then the chains shook wildly for several long minutes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I stopped working and sat down on the bones so that I could listen to the noise with more satisfaction. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the wall was nearly finished, loud screams suddenly burst from the chained man and pushed me back for a moment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I answered his screams with my own, louder and stronger, and at last he grew quiet.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "w", "e", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "d", "e", "e", "p", ",", " ", "n", "a", "r", "r", "o", "w", " ", "c", "r", "y", "p", "t", ",", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "b", "o", "n", "e", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "p", "i", "l", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "g", "h", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "o", "u", "r", "t", "h", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t